OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FThe London Bulgarian Choir live in
OL,7,     Fstudio. Curator Ann Dumas on
OL,8,     FPainting The French Riviera, a new
OL,9,     Fexhibition about to open at the
OL,10,     FRoyal Academy of Arts.
OL,11,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,12,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,14,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,15,     FElgar, Bernstein and Handel.
OL,16,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,17,     FJoe Stilgoe and his trio join the
OL,18,     FBBC Concert Orchestra and
OL,19,     Fconductor Fiona Monbet at
OL,20,     FAlexandra Palace Theatre in London
OL,21,     Ffor a concert of his own and other
OL,22,     Fjazz-infused music.
