OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FTonight, Soweto is in conversation
OL,7,     Fwith American saxophone colossus
OL,8,     FGary Bartz. They discuss
OL,9,     Feverything from his early
OL,10,     Finfluences, to working with Miles
OL,11,     Fand Max Roach, and more.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FViolinist Sebastian Bohren joins
OL,14,     Fthe Zurich Chamber Orchestra,
OL,15,     Fdirected from the violin by Daniel
OL,16,     FHope in music by Part, Schnittke
OL,17,     Fand Wettstein.
